    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n** VIRTUAL TOUR AVAILABLE **\n\nApt.8a Coachmans is a well positioned one bedroom, first floor apartment located on Dominick Street in the heart of Galway city. Offering an excellent opportunity for a first time buyer, investor or owner occupier, the property benefits from a highly convenient city centre location, with Galway's vast amenities all within easy walking distance.\n\nThis first floor apartment provides comfortable accommodation comprising a bedroom, living accommodation, kitchen and bathroom, making it an ideal choice for those seeking a manageable home in the centre of the city.\n\nThe location is one of the property's key attractions. Dominick Street is positioned close to Galway's famous West End, with its popular cafés, restaurants, bars and independent businesses. The Latin Quarter and Quay Street are also nearby, while the city's main shopping areas are easily accessible on foot. The University of Galway is approximately a 10-minute walk away, while Eyre Square and Galway city centre are also readily accessible. Galway Railway Station and the city's main bus connections provide convenient public transport links.\n\nFeatures:\n- Comprising c.387sq.ft. of living space\n- Prime city centre location\n- Fully managed complex\n- 2,300 mgmt fee per annum\n- Electric storage heating\n- PVC double glazing\n- Walking distance to University of Galway\n- 10 Minute walk to bus and train station\n\nDNG Leonard & Heaslip for themselves and for the vendors or lessors of the property whose Agents they are, give notice that: (i) The particulars are set out as a general outline for the guidance of intending purchasers or lessees, and do not constitute part of, an offer or contract. (ii) Any intending purchasers or tenants must not rely the descriptions, dimensions, references to condition or necessary permissions for use and occupation as statements or representations of fact but must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them. (iii) No person in the employment of DNG Leonard & Heaslip has any authority to make or give representation or warranty whatever in relation to this development. DNG Leonard & Heaslip accept no liability (including liability to any prospective purchaser or lessee by reason of negligence or negligent misstatement) for loss or damage caused by any statements, opinions, information or other matters (expressed or implied) arising out of, contained in or derived from, or for any omissions from this brochure."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nBedroom - 2.8m x 4.7m\nCarpet flooring, radiator\n\nBathroom - 1.7m x 1.7m\nTiled flooring, stand alone electric shower, WC, WHB\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 4.7m x 2.9m\nLaminate flooring, built in kitchen with electric oven and hob\n\n"
